{"id": "34914", "title": "霸王的新娘", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 39, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34914/34914s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34914.htm", "intro": "她，夏紫英，堂堂日夏食品的千金，竟然在一场交易下，轻易被哥哥“卖出了”！对象还是那个早八百年前就跟她梁子结很深的邢孟天！十二年前他不过是父亲司机的儿子，却可恨的比她这个正牌千金还得她父亲的宠爱；十二年后他有如霸王主宰她的一切，这小鼻子小眼睛的男人一定是为报小时候的仇，才“赌很大”的要娶她，本以为这辈子就这么“乌有去”，没想到他不知是良心发现还是头壳坏去，一下带她到北海岸度假说要培养感情，老婆老婆叫得她甜蜜蜜；一下说她煮的料理一百分，很给面子的吃得干干净净；本以为幸福的日子会这么过下去，偏偏讨厌的前男友跑来勾勾缠……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34914", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2311169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2311170.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2311171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2311172.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2311173.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2311174.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2311175.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2311176.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2311177.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2311178.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2311179.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2311180.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2311181.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2311182.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2311183.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2311184.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2311185.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2311186.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2311187.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2311188.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2311189.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2311190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2311191.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file